{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-direct-limit-algebra","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:direct-limit-algebra","kind":"definition","title":"Quantum Observable Universe as Direct Limit","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-recursive-brane-tower","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-c-quantum-observable-universe"],"examples":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-jet-shell","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-direct-limit-algebra-su2"],"tags":["direct-limit","algebra","brane-tower"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.DirectLimitAlgebra","text":"direct-limit-algebra.md","leanSource":"direct-limit-algebra.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:direct-limit-algebra\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a <a href=\"#def:quantum-observable-universe\" data-at=\"quantum-observable-universes/qou-definition\">quantum observable universe</a> with substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> and <a href=\"#def:recursive-brane-tower\" data-at=\"lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation\">recursive brane tower</a> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\{A_n\\}_{n \\geq 0}</code>. The <strong>direct limit algebra</strong> of the quantum observable universe is the colimit in the category of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-algebras:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathcal{A}_\\infty\n  = \n  \\varinjlim_{n}\n  \\mathrm{End}_{\\mathbf{C}}(A_n),</code></pre>\n<p>taken over the tower of endomorphism algebras with transition maps induced by the canonical embeddings <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A_n \\hookrightarrow A_{n+1}</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/direct-limit-algebra.md","heading":"Definition","number":"6.6.1","page":"b/def-direct-limit-algebra","qa":{"counts":{"pass":87,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":15,"unknown":0,"stale":76},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.DirectLimitAlgebra","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/direct-limit-algebra.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
